Add the docker compose support design document

COMPOSE-DESIGN.md records the design for dockerComposeFile support:
the rendered compose config as persisted model, compose project name
equal to the PodId, prepared image layered on the agent service's
image, docker cp injection of the static rumpel binary into sidecars,
direct per-container exec for port forwarding so the untrusted agent
never mediates host-to-sidecar traffic, stripping of published
ports:, and the spec-conformant overrideCommand default. No code
changes yet.
